            <cl:button comment="&lt;R>E-NAME: 조회 이벤트&#xD;&#xA;&lt;R>E-DOC: 입력된 고객번호로 고객정보 데이터 조회&#xD;&#xA;&lt;R>E-PARAM: CUST_NO:고객번호&#xD;&#xA;&lt;R>E-RR-UI-NAME:&#xD;&#xA;&lt;R>E-CALL-SRV-NAME: onBtnSearchClick()&#xD;&#xA;&lt;R>E-REP: 고객정보 조회&#xD;&#xA;&lt;R>E-REMARK: 컨트롤 ID : btnSearch" std:sid="button-df84d7d4" id="btnSearch_2" class="primary btn-search" value="조회" icon="../../../theme/images/controls/button/ic_btn.png">
